# Payload staging directory. Nothing here is committed.
#
# `prime-plugin.yaml` declares `sandbox.filesystem.readRoots: [data]`, and
# `plugin-host`'s `resolveInRoot` requires a declared read root to *exist* at
# manifest load time (`PATH_NOT_FOUND` otherwise). So this directory has to be
# tracked while its contents must not be — which is what this file does.
*
!.gitignore
